    "text": "4 Trillion of promises for projects that won't get off paper for 3 years. Once Trump is gone, so is the investment. Remember FoxConn that Trump was so proud of. A fraction of what was promised. https://www.jsonline.com/story/money/business/2023/03/23/what-we-know-about-foxconn-in-wisconsin-and-how-we-got-there/70037738007/\nYou've got to know this is mostly smoke and mirrors to make the continued inflation and cost of living increases that the people need to \"feel a little pain\" and it'll be worth it. Definitely worth it to the billionaire, venture capital, hedge fund, private equity company that skims straight from the top of all these deals to get theirs before they wither away until only the taxpayer loses. You honestly believe this is going to benefit you?",
